Cell["\<\
The four quenches of Table IV. Each run carries every digitized point \
(\"all\") and the subset retained by the selection rule of Appendix A (\"keep\
\"): the first and last point of each run are dropped following Ref. [7], and \
additionally the second point of the \[CapitalDelta]P = 2.00 MPa run, which \
begins later than the others. The reading error f is the plotted symbol \
half-size in natural-log units, Eq. (A1).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"172445ad-c0f8-4de9-969f-67c9d8333119"],

