Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Model and likelihood", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"99b91fa9-8de0-42c4-ba32-fbe116b08a7b"],

Cell["\<\
Eq. (8) is the prediction for the density, Eq. (10) the logarithmic residual \
of a single digitized point, and Eq. (13) the \[Chi]^2 of one quench after \
its offset \[Delta]_j has been marginalized out. chi2 sums Eq. (13) over a \
list of quenches. These definitions are symbolic-safe: they carry no NumericQ \
guards, so D and ContourPlot can be applied to them directly.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"559f73d7-4004-4773-b965-1aa928a3190b"],

