Cell["\<\
Figure 3(a). The point-by-point observable A_obs = L^2/(\[ScriptL]_d t), Eq. \
(4) applied to each datum separately with L0 dropped. It involves no fitting: \
a network on the attractor gives a horizontal line whatever its amplitude. \
The band is the group-2 result with its \[PlusMinus]1\[Sigma] interval.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ee2f3524-6524-4740-a03a-f57dc811f38f"],

