Cell["\<\
Figure 3(b). The single-quench amplitudes of Table II against quench depth, \
with the prior-limited errors of Eq. (16) applied to one run. Band and dashed \
line are the three-run result of Eq. (17).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"14c16714-dad5-45f3-96f4-a65829588f23"],

