Cell["\<\
Figure 4. The four quenches with the fitted curves. The three thick-cell runs \
share the amplitude of Eq. (17) and the \[CapitalDelta]P = 2.00 MPa run that \
of Eq. (18); within a group the curves differ only through the assigned \
\[ScriptL]_d of Eq. (9) and the fitted offsets of Eq. (12), so they are not \
independent fits. Each curve is drawn only over the span of its own retained \
data. Error bars are omitted because Ref. [7] states only that its \
statistical errors are smaller than the plotted symbols.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3b80af16-53d8-47c4-872f-33b30932a554"],

