Cell["\<\
Figure 5. Joint constraint on amplitude and exponent, contours at \
\[CapitalDelta]\[Chi]^2 = 2.30, 6.18 and 11.83, the 68%, 95% and 99.7% levels \
for two parameters jointly. Panel (a) is group 2, panel (b) group 1. Both are \
drawn by the same function.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c2601bad-9878-404c-942d-e32273e8fb21"],

